  <trk>
    <name>Green Valley Trail</name>
    <desc>This trail deserves the signet  “biker`s dream”. This singletrail is covered with roots and deep loam. The definition of flow will make all bikers grin like a Cheshire cat.</desc>
    <type>mountainbiking</type>
